1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
What did he say to them?

2
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:03,440
I don't want to romanticize it.

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,460
Once they have their helmets and gloves on,

4
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:08,000
they have basically their earplugs, kind of,

5
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,520
and then they have a cap that goes over that,

6
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:10,880
and then their helmets, and they just,

7
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,080
they aren't really able to hear really well.

8
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,520
But, he said, before the helmets went on...

9
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:21,100
I did give a little speech right when they got there,

10
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:22,260
but that was the only thing.

11
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:22,820
What'd you say?

12
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:24,540
I said, you know, we may only be strapping

13
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:25,560
the four of you in here today,

14
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,240
but the hopes and dreams of generations

15
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:29,540
are flying with you, this crew, this mission,

16
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:31,020
will inspire dreamers for decades.

17
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:32,660
Good luck, and Godspeed, Artemis II.

